OL,3,AHow much is the minimum wage going up
OL,4,Aby?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe official minimum rates of pay will
OL,7,Frise for 2.3 million workers on 1
OL,8,FApril.
OL,10,FThe rate for workers aged 21 and over
OL,11,Fis called the National Living Wage,
OL,12,Fwhile those aged 18 to 20 are paid the
OL,13,FNational Minimum Wage. They will both
OL,14,Fgo up by 3.9% next year.
OL,16,FThe rates apply across the UK.
OL,18,FFrom 1 April 2027, workers over 21 on
OL,19,Fthe National Living Wage will be paid
OL,20,F#13.21p per hour, up 50p from the
OL,21,Fcurrent #12.71 an hour.
OL,23,APub: 30-MayQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
